  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The identity for the same angle allows direct simplification without evaluating the sine and cosine separately.\n\nFor every real \\(\\alpha\\), \\(\\sin^2\\alpha+\\cos^2\\alpha=1\\), so replace the sum with \\(1\\), choice C.",
